# nocheck: persona-block-rationale — Fider's SSO entry is a two-step modal: the header "Sign in" button only opens the provider dialog, and a second click on "Continue with … SSO" performs the Keycloak redirect (files/playwright/playwright.spec.js, clickFiderSsoButton). The shared persona helper clicks once and never reaches the IdP, so the journey is owned by this role's own "fider: admin sso login" scenario instead (see README "Persona contract opt-outs").
PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true

# nocheck: persona-block-rationale — see PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED above; covered by this role's own "fider: biber sso login as regular user" scenario.
PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true

